**Fix:** In MSTest v4, the `out` parameter overload was removed. The generic `Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>()` now **returns `T` directly**, so replace:

```csharp
// Old (v3) – out parameter
Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>(value, out var typed);

// New (v4) – return value
var typed = Assert.IsInstanceOfType<T>(value);
```

